          calls, and winter ice calls land on the same two-person office. The
          phones are already busy when the surge hits. National figures on how
          often small businesses miss calls, and what those studies actually
          measured, are on our
          <a class="text-link" href="/learn/missed-call-statistics-2026/">missed-call statistics page</a>.
          Those are not NWA measurements, and this page does not pretend they are.
        </p>

        <h2 class="heading-lg measure">How missed call text back works</h2>
        <p>
          Three steps. A text within 60 seconds, an AI conversation, a booked job.
          Nothing in that chain sends until you have signed off on the wording.
        </p>
