          <li><strong>AI conversation.</strong> If they reply, the same rules you would use on a phone call run in the thread: service area, job type, what counts as an emergency, what information you need before a slot is real.</li>
          <li><strong>Booked job.</strong> A job that meets your rules gets a real slot on the calendar you already use. An emergency, by your definition, reaches your on-call person instead of landing on next Tuesday.</li>
        </ol>
